## NestJS Sample Project (No Database, With Relations)

### 📌 In-Memory Task Management System

---

## 🧠 Project Overview

Build a **Task Management API** with **Users, Projects, and Tasks** modules.
All data is stored **in memory**, but relationships are modeled exactly like a real database-backed app.

---

## 🧱 Modules Overview (3 Modules)

### 1️⃣ Users Module

Manages application users.

### 2️⃣ Projects Module

Each project belongs to **one user**.

### 3️⃣ Tasks Module

Each task belongs to **one project** and **one user**.

---

## 🔗 Relationships (In-Memory)

```
User (1) ──── (Many) Project
Project (1) ──── (Many) Task
User (1) ──── (Many) Task
```

Relationships are maintained using **IDs** (just like foreign keys).

