## 👤 User Model

```ts
export interface User {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  email: string;
}
```

---

## 📁 Project Model

```ts
export interface Project {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  ownerId: string; // User ID
}
```

---

## ✅ Task Model

```ts
export enum TaskStatus {
  OPEN = 'OPEN',
  IN_PROGRESS = 'IN_PROGRESS',
  DONE = 'DONE',
}

export interface Task {
  id: string;
  title: string;
  status: TaskStatus;
  userId: string;    // Assigned user
  projectId: string; // Parent project
}
```

---

## 🔌 Dependency Injection Flow

* `TasksService` injects `UsersService` and `ProjectsService`
* Validates relations before creating tasks
* Modules export services for cross-module usage

---

## 📦 Services Responsibility

### UsersService

* Create user
* Get user by ID

---

### ProjectsService

* Create project
* Ensure project belongs to user

---

### TasksService

* Create task
* Validate:

  * User exists
  * Project exists
  * Project belongs to user
* Update task status
* Delete task

---

## 🌐 API Endpoints

### 👤 Users

```http
POST /users
GET  /users
```

---

### 📁 Projects

```http
POST /projects
GET  /projects/user/:userId
```

---

### ✅ Tasks

```http
POST   /tasks
GET    /tasks/project/:projectId
PATCH  /tasks/:id
DELETE /tasks/:id
```

